        long: Ut.longDescription(`"Nonessential services" covers three outbound fetches the app runs without: **connector favicons** (the icon proxy), the **artifact-preview** iframe origin, and the **MCP Apps widget** iframe origin (\`*.claudemcpcontent.com\`). Turning this on blocks all three.\n\n**What you lose when this is on:** connectors show without icons, artifacts do not render in conversations, and connectors that return MCP Apps show the text tool result instead of the widget.\n\nDestinations are listed under Egress Requirements \u2192 Nonessential services.`)
